msgctxt "64"
msgid "...Hey! You! Excuse me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Huh? You talking to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Sorry to bother you, but are you Kazuma Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Yeah, that's me... and you are?"
msgstr "Sì, sono io. E tu chi sei?"

msgctxt "124"
msgid "I knew it! I'm a student at the Komaki Dojo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Komaki Dojo..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Oh, you mean old man Komaki? Haven't seen him in forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "He started his own dojo, huh? Sounds like he's doing pretty well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Yes, sir, he is! I actually have a letter for you from him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "He told me to give it to you if I ever spotted you in the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Letter from Komaki<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "A letter from Komaki? Wonder what he wants..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"How are you doing, my prized pupil? When I heard you'd returned to "
"Kamurocho, I knew I must pen a letter to you at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"I am currently running a dojo at the Dragon Palace. I believe you're quite "
"familiar with the location."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"I understand that while I was away on a short trip, you fought off some "
"hooligans that were making trouble at the Dragon Palace. I wanted to extend "
"my thanks to you for that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"From the rumors I've heard, your life of peace and tranquility has not "
"dulled your fighting edge. Knowing you, however, I suspect that way of life "
"may not last much longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"If you ever feel the need to train again, please stop by my dojo at the "
"Dragon Palace. I'd be happy to help you get back into shape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"However, there is one matter that may require your help.\r\n"
"I'll tell you more when we meet in person.\r\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　Sotaro Komaki, Komaki Dojo"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Heh. I swear, that old man never changes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"It has been a while since we last saw one another. Maybe I should go and pay"
" old man Komaki a visit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Hey. Is the old man back at the dojo now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Yes, Master Komaki has returned. Please take the elevator to the dojo floor."
" I'll go on ahead and let him know you're here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"The dojo at the Dragon Palace, huh... I should stop by when I have a minute."
msgstr ""

